{"id":"n83247-1-9","stage":3,"title":"폐지 · 废止","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83247-1-9-1","ko":"내가 즐겨 보던 프로그램이 폐지가 될 예정이래.","zh":"听说我常看的那个节目要停播了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"즐겨","meaning":"喜欢，爱","explanation":"즐기다：喜欢，爱；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"즐기다","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91878","senseId":"2","lemma":"즐기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐겨","audio":"/audio/1d646d0dc22c7c9b9396.mp3"}},{"text":"보던","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보던","audio":"/audio/2e6646704459019ac5cf.mp3"}},{"text":"프로그램이","meaning":"节目，节目单","explanation":"프로그램：节目，节目单；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"프로그램","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60621","senseId":"2","lemma":"프로그램","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"프로그램이","audio":"/audio/0063a99ea9de987cf268.mp3"}},{"text":"폐지가","meaning":"取消、停播（节目）","explanation":"폐지 用于制度或事物停止实行；本句对象是电视节目，中文用取消、停播。后面的 될 예정 表示计划或预定，-이래 转述听来的消息。","readings":[{"term":"폐지","audio":"/audio/b3b0fce5c54288ef7440.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83247","senseId":"1","lemma":"폐지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"폐지가","audio":"/audio/416d6f8be04f61f88c3c.mp3"}},{"text":"될","meaning":"被取消、变成停播状态","explanation":"되다：变成某种状态；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"될","audio":"/audio/dc84eeabbbd47f74f20a.mp3"}},{"text":"예정이래.","meaning":"预定","explanation":"예정：预定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；래：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"예정","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66576","senseId":"1","lemma":"예정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예정이래","audio":"/audio/7869a0b747010b8ccb5f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"52a5578b574f2755","term":"즐기다","zh":"喜欢，爱","audio":"/audio/52a5578b574f2755fc41.mp3","entryId":"91878","definition":"喜爱做某事而经常做。","pronunciation":["즐기다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"f5044b9ba86548c9","term":"프로그램","zh":"节目，节目单","audio":"/audio/f5044b9ba86548c9549b.mp3","entryId":"60621","definition":"在广播、电视等里，按时间段播放的内容；或指其顺序或目录。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b3b0fce5c54288ef","term":"폐지","zh":"废止、撤销、取消","audio":"/audio/b3b0fce5c54288ef7440.mp3","entryId":"83247","definition":"废止、撤销、取消","pronunciation":["폐ː지","페ː지"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变成某种状态","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变成某种状态","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"8688e9ff7c84e0e4","term":"예정","zh":"预定","audio":"/audio/8688e9ff7c84e0e44571.mp3","entryId":"66576","definition":"提前定下或预想将来的事情。","pronunciation":["예ː정"]}],"audio":"/audio/725a10f36aac366b7b03.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83247-1-9-2","ko":"그래? 아쉽겠다.","zh":"是吗？真可惜啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"아쉽겠다.","meaning":"可惜，舍不得，依依不舍","explanation":"아쉽다：可惜，舍不得，依依不舍；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"아쉽다","audio":"/audio/b90537aecebf988b4b9b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14687","senseId":"2","lemma":"아쉽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아쉽겠다","audio":"/audio/06a389a7e6d763afe457.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于对对方所说的话表示感叹或轻微的惊讶。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"b90537aecebf988b","term":"아쉽다","zh":"可惜，舍不得，依依不舍","audio":"/audio/b90537aecebf988b4b9b.mp3","entryId":"14687","definition":"存有一些留恋而感到惋惜、遗憾。","pronunciation":["아쉽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/4f3e5a6fc8b9db1dc424.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.633,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83247","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是吗？真可惜啊。","听说我常看的那个节目要停播了。","好好学习不就行了，知道那些干什么？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我常看的那个节目好像要停播了。","好好学习不就行了，知道那些干什么？","是吗？真可惜啊。"],"answer":2}]}
